      {
        "id": 204480,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-25T16:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"speedyolrac\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/48/1918_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> speedyolrac:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There is a B5 board game that was fun, even though it went on for 2.5 hours. I was found out as a Cylon&nbsp;early on,</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>B5 is not BattleStar Galactica ( BSG)  , B5 had an actual plan from the get go, unlike BSG.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Did anyone here ever play the card game?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The card game, yeah I played it quite a bit, entering local tornaments and stuff. I still have all my cards, including 2 signed Mordens (I lucked out and got from packs), and one of the many&nbsp;  John Sheridan cards I got signed at a Bruce Boxleitner book launch!</p>",
