      {
        "id": 204485,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-26T04:37:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>B5 is not BattleStar Galactica (BSG), B5 had an actual plan from the get go, unlike BSG.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Until they thought they were going to be cancelled, did that “visit the future” season ender, and then got renewed and had to completely forward-retcon their way into the ending they wrote for themselves, right? The show really took a dive starting from that season.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:33:37.947Z",
