      {
        "id": 204486,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-26T04:43:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honestly I think the whole \"the fifth season was terrible\" is more half-rememberance than anything. The telepath arc <em>was</em> pretty bad, but the arc with Londo and G'Kar on Centauri Prime was great, and Day of the Dead was arguably the best guest-written episode of the series.</p>",
